  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can switch freely between channeling the power of life and death.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Versatile Channeler<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You no longer treat your cleric level as 2 lower when channeling the opposite type of energy. In addition, you may channel both negative and positive energy simultaneously, dividing your total number of channeling dice between the two. You must still decide whether you are channeling each type of energy to harm or heal. Feats and abilities that allow you to exclude or target specific creatures within your burst can be applied to either or both types of energy, but the total number of creatures you can exclude remains unchanged.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc27\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
